 clobbered sase_agent_recovery note and guard against [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]note clobbers[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]`bob ref scan -w` runs clean on the MacBook again with the lost [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]agent-recovery project restored; the review walk never leaves an [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]unsaved plugin write behind when it switches notes; and any future [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]whole-note clobber is caught by vault-sync and named plainly in [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]bob's output instead of surfacing days later as cryptic ref-scan [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]refusals.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]clobbered_note_repair_and_guards.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/clobbered_note_repair_and_guards.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-do[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-do/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Restore the clobbered note and verify the scan[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]vault-repair[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault-repair: restore sase_agent_recovery.md from 8ca09ee75^, let bob [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]task reconcile drop 8 stale mirror links, verify ref scan on athena and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the MacBook, sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Save before the review walk switches notes[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]walk-save-guard[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]walk-save-guard: in bob-navigation-hotkeys, flush and verify the active [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]note before any same-pane note switch, add a clobber tripwire on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]landing, test, build, deploy.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Vault-sync clobber detection and quarantine[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]sync-clobber-guard[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]sync-clobber-guard: detect displaced-plus-foreign-identity rewrites of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tracked notes before staging, quarantine or warn per the decision, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record in status, alert, document, test.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Name duplicated-task copies in ref scan failures[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]ref-scan-copy-hint[dim] · [dim][/dim]after sync-clobber-guard[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ref-scan-copy-hint: make multiple_open_ref_tasks say when the claimants [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]are copies of one task, and group repeated refusals into one cause line [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pointing at the clobber runbook.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-do","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-do.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-60008e8cb15ff32e3045be5db662328b","started_at":"2026-10-28T14:50:15.301657+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"139b2b730dd72b2aa792b3f4885b3e7dcaa970d1eb60fd5b06104b5e2fc81766","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-do.land--gate/chat.md","size_byt